\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 VILNIUS - The introduction of universal conscription in Lithuania would send a strong political message to allies, the country's new Chief of Defense Raimundas Vaiksnoras says, adding, however, that such a model can only be introduced after proper preparations.}
